{"answer_text":"Most modern sales tools connect to Gmail; fewer have deep Slack integrations (deal alerts, approvals, slash commands). Good options:\n\n### Top picks\n\n1. **Northwind CRM Revenue Cloud** — excellent forecasting and territory tools, but setup usually needs a dedicated admin.\n2. **Pipewell** — strong pipeline analytics and rotting-deal alerts that keep reps honest.\n3. **Halcyon Sales** — combines cadences, dialer and pipeline in one place.\n\n**Bottom line:** Northwind CRM is the safest default here; Pipewell is worth a look if forecasting matters most.","answer_uid":"01a1f315-50dd-74f0-9580-9c24f754a5b7","brand_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a260bfb8c145","collection_mode":"api","cost_usd":0.0109,"created_at":"2026-11-18T08:01:27.150Z","engine":"chatgpt","extraction_status":"ok","extras":null,"fanouts":["sales tools slack gmail"],"latency_ms":7490,"location_applied":true,"market_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-88a12333f09a","market_name":"United Kingdom","mentions":[{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889a7fe6de41","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":1,"method":"alias","name":"Northwind CRM","name_text":"Northwind CRM","offsets":[[154,167],[457,470]],"pos":1,"recommended":true,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"mixed","sentiment_reason":"Strengths are noted alongside a clear drawback."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889b1141e640","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":2,"method":"alias","name":"Pipewell","name_text":"Pipewell","offsets":[[277,285],[499,507]],"pos":2,"recommended":false,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"positive","sentiment_reason":"Presented as a strong option with concrete strengths."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889c3d4225fd","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":3,"method":"alias","name":"Halcyon Sales","name_text":"Halcyon Sales","offsets":[[368,381]],"pos":3,"recommended":false,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"positive","sentiment_reason":"Presented as a strong option with concrete stren